itiesPerLine, so importEntitiesPerRequest=1 floors their\nlinesPerRequest to 0 and crashes the whole shared Gatling simulation before\nInpatient's own single-event scenario even starts. Add\n-DinpatientEntitiesPerRequest (defaulting to importEntitiesPerRequest, so\nexisting behavior is unchanged) to let Inpatient's batch size move\nindependently -- needed to measure genuine single-event-per-request import,\nwhich is how single-event programs like Inpatient are actually used in\nproduction, unlike tracker programs importing multiple events per tracked\nentity. Also floor linesPerRequest at 1 generally, so a misconfigured batch\nsize degrades gracefully instead of crashing the simulation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"a4ebf2e74721d6e3547d8a568ef00411f7a71f85","tree_id":"4b5d990a14d0cc9cf814adc2f7ecb011cf407112","timestamp":"2026-08-09T07:08:19Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/starred{